window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Welcome back fans. Whether you have read my Autobiography and or my collection of poems the real meat and potatoes of what makes me tick is inside this collection of Erotica. It is what got me to the dance so to speak. While my autobiography has been an incredible success it pales in comparison to the success that is my pen name unsettlednomad. As I mention in the opening to <i>Eat Shit Live</i> over Five thousand people a week read my Erotica and I thought that I should bring some of the calmer stories to you in this forum in case you were afraid to go to the sites where my works are posted. They are short and humorous but they will manage to get you to the point where you need to go depending on your kink. You may recall that before I started writing I used to own a fully equipped and operational dungeon and that my expertise is pain and complete submission. So with that in mind relax and pour yourself a nice glass of wine and let yourself go. Submit to me for I am the Alpha and the Omega and I am the reason that you are here.</p>"; 
